        "The quantity $\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i$ is known as the **total time at risk**, which is the sum of the observed times for all units, regardless of whether they failed or were censored. Each unit contributes to the total time at risk based on its observed duration. The quantity $\\sum_{i=1}^n \\delta_i$ is the total number of observed failures.\n",
